The newer egcs toolchain in NetBSD-current will include g77 once the
toolchain is updated.  Also, you should be able to compile the egcs
snapshots yourself (egcs 1.0.x is _not_ Alpha friendly).  See:
    http://www.cygnus.com/egcs/
