reasons, but right now it looks like you just have bad floppy media, or
some other problem affecting your hardware and/or console firmware. It
definitely doesn't look like a problem in the NetBSD boot code itself. How
much RAM is in that system? Which version of the NetBSD install floppy did
you use?


